<<
/Title (Column pruning checks units, tens, hundreds, and higher columns as soon as enough digits are known. If a column cannot satisfy its sum and carry, that partial assignment is abandoned immediately. This reduces the number of combinations explored compared with plain backtracking.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 624 0 R
>>
endobj
